WEBVTT

00:00.580 --> 00:05.880
<i>The Kingdom of Salutania was threatened 
by a sudden increase in monsters.</i>

00:06.660 --> 00:10.700
<i>Because of that threat, they performed 
the Saint Summoning Ritual.</i>

00:11.320 --> 00:13.830
<i>Long ago, when there were no Holy Saints,</i>

00:13.830 --> 00:18.160
<i>a savior from another world 
once banished the darkness.</i>

00:18.590 --> 00:20.720
<i>At least, that's what they say.</i>

00:20.720 --> 00:23.810
<i>However, two holy maidens 
were summoned at once.</i>

00:24.300 --> 00:27.580
<i>In the end, I was casually abandoned.</i>

00:28.260 --> 00:32.550
<i>Well, I was a little like, 
"What?" at the time, but...</i>

00:32.550 --> 00:34.380
<i>That was a different issue.</i>

00:34.380 --> 00:36.560
<i>The unfortunate event led 
to fortunate results.</i>

00:37.170 --> 00:41.310
<i>I was lucky enough to meet wonderful people</i>

00:41.310 --> 00:43.940
<i>and spend my days peacefully 
surrounded by the warmth of others.</i>

00:44.610 --> 00:49.070
<i>Oh, I guess the days weren't <i>all</i> peaceful...</i>

00:49.820 --> 00:54.740
<i>Anyway, a lot of things happened, 
and I ended up being the true Holy Saint.</i>

00:56.520 --> 00:58.870
<i>After that, I learned magic...</i>

00:58.870 --> 01:03.740
<i>And I used the Holy Saint powers 
that I don't really understand.</i>

01:04.250 --> 01:07.590
<i>I went around the kingdom 
to purify miasma swamps,</i>

01:07.590 --> 01:10.400
<i>which are the source of the monsters.</i>

01:11.260 --> 01:14.320
<i>I just want the people I've met</i>

01:14.320 --> 01:17.260
<i>to continue living their lives 
with smiles on their faces.</i>

01:17.700 --> 01:21.440
<i>That's the reason I've always 
done all that I could.</i>

01:22.210 --> 01:30.110
<i>That's why I've never considered how long 
I'd have to fulfill my duties as a Saint.</i>

01:55.540 --> 01:57.330
The air feels so refreshing.

01:57.330 --> 01:58.160
Sei.

02:01.070 --> 02:02.480
Commander Hawke.

02:02.480 --> 02:06.850
I'm sure that traveling to the 
fringes of the kingdom was tiring.

02:06.850 --> 02:07.940
Not at all!

02:08.880 --> 02:11.900
The scenery all around us 
is so beautiful. How can I be tired?

02:13.900 --> 02:17.400
I see. I'm happy that you like the scenery.

02:18.030 --> 02:20.370
The others are preparing some tea.

02:21.150 --> 02:23.420
Let's go warm up.

02:23.420 --> 02:24.440
Yes.

02:24.440 --> 02:27.380
Commander! Will this area work?

02:40.360 --> 02:42.060
<i>This is the Hawke Domain.</i>

02:42.780 --> 02:45.750
<i>The commander's hometown...</i>

04:16.990 --> 04:19.990
"Frontier"

04:27.510 --> 04:32.500
Thank you for coming 
to such a remote region, Holy Saint.

04:33.190 --> 04:35.960
I am the head of the family, Helmut Hawke.

04:35.960 --> 04:38.420
I am his wife, Claudia.

04:39.230 --> 04:41.890
Nice to meet you. My name is Sei Takanashi.

04:43.600 --> 04:45.600
<i>They're the commander's parents.</i>

04:45.600 --> 04:47.570
<i>I feel really nervous for some reason.</i>

04:48.060 --> 04:53.820
Grand Magus Drewes, I am embarrassed 
for making you come out this far.

04:53.820 --> 04:56.300
No, think nothing of it.

04:56.300 --> 04:59.240
It is my duty to protect the kingdom.

04:59.520 --> 05:01.270
How promising.

05:01.270 --> 05:06.370
The stories of your contributions have 
even reached the fringes of the kingdom.

05:06.680 --> 05:11.120
We are very much obliged 
to you for your visit here.

05:11.120 --> 05:13.060
<i>Their hair and eye colors 
are exactly the same.</i>

05:15.670 --> 05:18.020
<i>But his facial features 
are more like his mom's...</i>

05:18.510 --> 05:23.220
Commander Hawke, thank you 
for your speedy march here.

05:23.530 --> 05:27.930
Thank you very much 
for your praise, Margrave.

05:27.930 --> 05:29.620
<i>They're so formal to each other!</i>

05:40.510 --> 05:42.360
Welcome home.

05:42.360 --> 05:43.690
I'm home.

06:03.510 --> 06:04.610
My apologies.

06:05.330 --> 06:09.470
My mother has always liked to go 
all-out when we have guests.

06:15.930 --> 06:19.910
Isn't everyone departing tomorrow morning?

06:19.910 --> 06:24.610
Please allow us to show you our
 utmost hospitality this evening.

06:26.620 --> 06:28.180
It looks delicious!

06:32.510 --> 06:33.810
<i>Delicious!</i>

06:33.810 --> 06:36.010
<i>It's all so movingly delicious!</i>

06:36.010 --> 06:38.500
<i>I can't stop eating the gourmet 
delights of the Hawke Region!</i>

06:38.500 --> 06:40.460
Does it suit your tastes?

06:40.460 --> 06:42.110
Yes, very much so.

06:42.110 --> 06:44.430
You use a lot of cheese.

06:44.430 --> 06:48.390
Yes, our region is famous 
for the production of cheese.

06:50.760 --> 06:54.060
The wine is also exquisitely rich and mellow.

06:54.060 --> 06:56.310
That is also made in our region.

06:57.220 --> 06:59.590
We would love our guests from the royal palace

06:59.590 --> 07:03.280
to take in the sights of our
 region at their leisure.

07:03.280 --> 07:05.740
Yes, we would love to if time permits.

07:05.740 --> 07:09.520
The lake in the north is famous 
for its scenic beauty.

07:09.520 --> 07:11.700
There is even a hot spring near its vicinity.

07:12.100 --> 07:13.160
Hot springs!

07:17.230 --> 07:19.290
Are you interested in hot springs?

07:19.290 --> 07:21.370
Um, ah, yes...

07:21.370 --> 07:24.800
We had them in back home, too, 
but I didn't really have time to go.

07:25.210 --> 07:27.760
I had always wanted to go to one.

07:27.760 --> 07:29.660
Is that so?

07:29.660 --> 07:33.470
We own a villa in a town near the hot spring.

07:33.470 --> 07:36.370
Please feel free to stay there.

07:36.370 --> 07:37.830
Is that really all right?

07:37.830 --> 07:38.940
Of course.

07:38.940 --> 07:43.650
We'll have to stay a few days after 
the subjugation for investigations.

07:43.970 --> 07:47.700
I would love to show you 
around during that time, Sei.

07:47.700 --> 07:49.620
Oh, thank you very much.

08:04.630 --> 08:06.230
<i>I'm so tired.</i>

08:06.730 --> 08:08.440
<i>The food was delicious,</i>

08:08.440 --> 08:14.090
<i>and the dinner was very enjoyable thanks to 
the commander and the Grand Magus,</i>

08:15.760 --> 08:17.660
<i>but I feel so exhausted.</i>

08:17.660 --> 08:22.200
<i>This must be backlash 
from meeting "the parents."</i>

08:22.200 --> 08:24.130
<i>I want to recover with some potions.</i>

08:24.130 --> 08:25.030
Sei...

08:26.740 --> 08:28.700
Commander Hawke?

08:28.700 --> 08:32.740
I wanted to escort you to your room, 
but you were already gone.

08:33.150 --> 08:34.660
I was worried.

08:34.660 --> 08:37.800
I-I'm sorry, I was a little tired.

08:38.120 --> 08:40.490
It was an exceptionally long journey.

08:40.820 --> 08:43.840
Even so, you still attended the dinner...

08:44.480 --> 08:45.520
Thank you.

08:46.330 --> 08:50.440
N-No, it was very enjoyable and delicious.

08:50.440 --> 08:52.220
It cheered me up quite a bit.

08:52.220 --> 08:53.350
I see.

09:05.270 --> 09:09.340
We're heading out a little early tomorrow. 
I hope you have a restful evening.

09:09.340 --> 09:11.140
Thank you very much.

09:11.140 --> 09:13.240
Well then, good night.

09:13.650 --> 09:15.030
Good night.

09:46.570 --> 09:48.410
A mine?

09:49.070 --> 09:55.060
Yes. The miners who work there 
have reported monster sightings.

09:55.060 --> 09:57.140
The numbers reported continue 
to increase by the day.

09:57.140 --> 09:58.490
I worry that soon...

09:58.490 --> 10:01.460
Then the miasma swamp 
is probably near that area.

10:01.460 --> 10:03.670
Yes, it's highly likely.

10:04.190 --> 10:09.130
Margrave, we will leave early 
tomorrow morning to go to that mine.

10:11.020 --> 10:12.110
I see.

10:12.110 --> 10:16.280
There's a temporary settlement near 
the foot of the mountain for the miners.

10:16.280 --> 10:18.650
I would suggest heading there first.

10:19.430 --> 10:21.760
It seems you've become quite reliable, Al.

10:43.030 --> 10:45.420
What a strange atmosphere.

10:45.740 --> 10:47.640
Is no one here?

10:48.130 --> 10:50.770
Is everyone out working?

10:50.770 --> 10:54.840
No, I heard that the mine had been 
sealed off due to the monster problem.

10:59.470 --> 11:00.930
What was that just now?

11:04.340 --> 11:06.310
Looks like something happened!

11:08.530 --> 11:11.730
<i>I've never seen someone get so excited 
about a scream.</i>

11:26.960 --> 11:28.440
Ground Spear!

11:42.340 --> 11:43.910
Are you hurt?

11:43.910 --> 11:45.560
N-No, I'm okay...

11:45.560 --> 11:47.520
Who're you guys?

11:47.520 --> 11:49.700
We're the subjugation unit 
dispatched by the royal palace.

11:49.700 --> 11:50.840
You'll be all right now!

11:59.070 --> 12:01.090
We're saved!

12:01.090 --> 12:03.540
Thank you very much, sir knights!

12:10.210 --> 12:12.180
Make sure to set it up properly over there!

12:12.180 --> 12:13.170
Leave it to me!

12:17.340 --> 12:20.680
I'd heard that monsters appeared near the mine,

12:20.680 --> 12:24.120
but they've even attacked 
the settlement in the foothills?

12:24.120 --> 12:27.300
The attack this time was not too bad.

12:27.300 --> 12:30.710
The situation in the mine is outrageous.

12:30.710 --> 12:33.410
Monsters originally appeared 
from time to time,

12:33.410 --> 12:37.880
but the margrave and his soldiers 
always managed to clear them out.

12:37.880 --> 12:39.740
But lately...

12:39.740 --> 12:43.990
The number of monsters has grown 
each day, until now it's unmanageable.

12:44.490 --> 12:46.700
So you asked us for help.

12:46.700 --> 12:51.560
Now, monsters we've never seen 
before have started to appear.

12:52.040 --> 12:54.410
Monsters you've never seen before?

12:54.410 --> 12:56.090
Y-Yes.

12:56.090 --> 12:59.010
We've only seen living monsters, but...

12:59.550 --> 13:02.160
That's... Well...

13:04.140 --> 13:06.760
They're monsters that aren't alive.

13:07.730 --> 13:09.250
Undead.

13:09.810 --> 13:11.020
Huh?!

13:11.020 --> 13:15.230
<i>Undead? Like the ones in video games?!</i>

13:15.230 --> 13:18.420
Either way, the mining has been put on hold.

13:18.420 --> 13:22.280
It will be safer if everyone 
evacuates this area.

13:23.030 --> 13:25.660
If you're here, we can't go all-out.

13:25.660 --> 13:27.870
<i>I think I heard him mumble something...</i>

13:27.870 --> 13:30.810
We'd all love to do that,

13:30.810 --> 13:36.010
but there are heavily injured people here 
that we can't easily move.

13:36.010 --> 13:39.340
Leave them to me. 
I'll take care of them.

13:39.340 --> 13:42.350
We will tend to the injured, 
increase the defenses of the settlement,

13:42.350 --> 13:45.480
and secure a safe evacuation route.

13:45.480 --> 13:50.200
You would do all that?
Thank you very much!

13:50.200 --> 13:52.840
We'll move out first thing in the morning.

13:53.510 --> 13:54.840
I understand.

13:54.840 --> 13:59.280
But the path to the mine is already 
in shambles from fighting with the monsters.

13:59.880 --> 14:04.410
There is a small path 
that we used to evacuate.

14:04.410 --> 14:08.740
It's not much, but please allow us 
to have someone lead you to that path.

14:09.310 --> 14:10.500
I appreciate it.

14:14.740 --> 14:17.590
Oh, faster than I expected.

14:22.490 --> 14:23.010
Huh?

14:23.670 --> 14:25.830
Thank you for your hard work, Lady Sei!

14:25.830 --> 14:28.850
Lady Sei! Lady Sei!

14:29.680 --> 14:31.680
<i>There are more knights?</i>

14:35.260 --> 14:36.890
How did this happen?

14:36.890 --> 14:39.110
They all want to pay you back, Sei.

14:39.110 --> 14:45.250
That's why there's always a ton of volunteers 
for subjugation and rescue missions.

14:45.250 --> 14:47.700
Well, I understand how they feel.

14:47.700 --> 14:51.660
Yeah, and they say this subjugation 
expedition shouldn't be too long.

14:51.960 --> 14:52.620
Huh?

14:52.620 --> 14:56.330
Everyone here has been helped 
by you at one time or another.

14:56.330 --> 14:58.580
They want to take this chance 
to pay you back.

14:58.580 --> 15:01.590
Help you while they still can.

15:01.590 --> 15:07.290
Huh? Um, does that mean the miasma 
swamp expeditions are almost over?

15:07.290 --> 15:10.190
Well, we don't know for sure, but...

15:10.190 --> 15:11.350
Aren't they?

15:11.770 --> 15:14.730
The people in the royal palace 
have been saying so.

15:14.730 --> 15:17.040
I see...

15:17.640 --> 15:20.440
<i>It doesn't feel real.</i>

15:21.190 --> 15:26.870
Isn't it true that all the regions except 
this one have decreased in monsters?

15:27.230 --> 15:29.470
All thanks to Sei, right?

15:29.470 --> 15:30.790
For sure.

15:30.790 --> 15:34.660
It's because Sei went all over the place 
to purify the miasma swamps.

15:34.660 --> 15:36.620
It feels kind of weird saying it 
at this point, but...

15:36.620 --> 15:39.160
Sei, thank you so much.

15:46.740 --> 15:49.060
I'm glad the reinforcements came in time.

15:49.440 --> 15:53.140
We can leave the defense 
and evacuation to them

15:53.140 --> 15:56.430
and take our current team to the mine.

15:56.430 --> 15:57.990
That's right.

15:57.990 --> 16:02.360
It's practically a certainty 
that the miasma swamp is there.

16:03.860 --> 16:05.170
Lady Sei?

16:06.070 --> 16:08.280
Oh, I'm sorry.

16:08.280 --> 16:10.320
Are you all right?

16:13.230 --> 16:17.840
Um, is this the last expedition 
to purify miasma swamps?

16:21.380 --> 16:23.670
Is that a problem?

16:23.670 --> 16:24.710
Of course not!

16:24.710 --> 16:26.190
That's not it.

16:26.190 --> 16:28.680
Just, um...

16:29.380 --> 16:33.100
It doesn't really feel like the end.

16:33.550 --> 16:37.340
I've never really thought 
about things deeply until now.

16:37.340 --> 16:42.570
Well, that's not true. But I helped 
because the kingdom wanted me to,

16:42.570 --> 16:46.340
and I thought it'd put 
the people here at ease, and...

16:46.340 --> 16:48.280
That's all, so...

16:48.790 --> 16:53.990
I didn't really imagine a beginning 
and an ending for it all.

16:54.550 --> 17:01.750
I'm a little taken aback 
that there'll be an end to this.

17:04.340 --> 17:08.390
It is our first time dealing with the 
growing miasma and the Holy Saint,

17:08.390 --> 17:12.430
so we cannot be sure ourselves.

17:12.430 --> 17:15.880
However, according to the historical 
records of the Holy Saint

17:15.880 --> 17:20.090
and what we've seen 
while traveling with you...

17:20.090 --> 17:24.400
His Majesty and I believe that the 
miasma swamp in the Hawke Region

17:24.860 --> 17:27.820
is probably the last one.

17:29.570 --> 17:35.450
Our research has shown that most monsters 
are born from these miasma swamps.

17:35.770 --> 17:40.160
And these swamps have 
a certain area of effect.

17:40.710 --> 17:43.120
Once these swamps 
are purified by the Holy Saint,

17:43.120 --> 17:47.100
the monsters affected by the swamp 
are completely annihilated.

17:47.680 --> 17:50.780
We have not seen any monsters

17:50.780 --> 17:53.560
other than the ones that originally inhabited 
the area since a purification.

17:54.280 --> 17:57.490
Let's calculate this according 
to the regions of our kingdom.

17:57.810 --> 18:01.810
If we mark each miasma swamp 
that we found and purified...

18:01.810 --> 18:08.530
And if we calculate each 
of their areas of effect...

18:09.090 --> 18:12.990
The only area left is the Hawke Region.

18:14.700 --> 18:18.160
<i>The Grand Magus's drawings are really cute.</i>

18:18.160 --> 18:23.500
So first, we need to find the swamp 
that is increasing monsters in this area.

18:23.500 --> 18:25.160
Then we purify it.

18:25.160 --> 18:26.850
What happens afterwards...

18:26.850 --> 18:29.800
we can think about when the time comes.

18:38.330 --> 18:40.030
The end, huh?

18:43.520 --> 18:45.720
Lady Sei! We wish you success!

18:45.720 --> 18:48.980
Leave everything here to us!

18:48.980 --> 18:51.260
Th-Thank you very much.

18:51.260 --> 18:53.550
Lady Sei, it's time to go!

18:53.550 --> 18:55.070
Oh! Yes!

18:55.070 --> 18:57.950
Okay, everyone. See you at the royal palace.

18:59.910 --> 19:01.060
Hello.

19:01.060 --> 19:05.500
I'll guide all of you to the mine.

19:05.500 --> 19:08.320
Thank you. We appreciate your cooperation.

19:22.760 --> 19:23.560
Wait.

19:24.160 --> 19:25.000
Yes?

19:25.640 --> 19:27.480
Something is coming.

19:27.890 --> 19:29.690
Everyone in position!

19:30.030 --> 19:31.400
Yes!

19:35.320 --> 19:37.530
The monsters from yesterday!

19:46.330 --> 19:47.830
Ground Spear!

20:00.960 --> 20:01.900
Huh?

20:16.610 --> 20:17.820
Wha?!

20:21.240 --> 20:23.270
N-No way...

20:23.270 --> 20:24.900
What's going on?

20:25.530 --> 20:27.040
Why won't they die?!

20:27.620 --> 20:29.220
Because they're already dead!

20:33.860 --> 20:35.080
Undead...

20:35.080 --> 20:36.130
How troublesome.

20:36.670 --> 20:39.090
I can't believe such monsters
are appearing, too.

20:43.770 --> 20:45.000
As expected of the Grand Magus!

20:45.000 --> 20:47.180
It's too early to let your guard down.

20:48.030 --> 20:49.280
New monsters?!

20:49.710 --> 20:51.390
The howl just now!

20:51.390 --> 20:52.900
It called allies!

20:52.900 --> 20:55.110
Lord Drewes, can you still fight?

20:55.110 --> 20:58.320
Do I have a choice in a situation like this?

20:58.320 --> 21:00.410
Good point. Let's go!

21:13.780 --> 21:15.090
What the heck is that?!

21:16.800 --> 21:18.710
It's way too huge...

21:18.710 --> 21:20.940
It's way bigger than a salamander...

21:21.310 --> 21:22.950
I've never seen anything like it.

21:22.950 --> 21:24.510
What are we going to do now?

21:47.900 --> 21:52.670
Looks like we have no choice 
but to go forth and find out.

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
Next Episode

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
"Final Act"
